This package contains a ROS-free adaptation of the Super-LIO algorithmic
pipeline in src/algorithm/slam/super_lio.cpp.

Upstream project: Super-LIO
Source reference retained in: autonomy-main/third_party/super_lio_ros2
Upstream license: GNU General Public License version 3

The ROSWrapper, ROS publishers/subscribers, and standalone super_lio_node are
not included in the runtime. SensorManager provides LiDAR/IMU samples directly
to the embedded core, and IoManager publishes its results.
